Recipe ../../capture-callredir.sh; CAPTURE-DONE barrier.
AUTOEXEC on B: runs CALL CHILD.BAT > TRACE.TXT (child ECHOs CHILD-RAN)
and CALL NOPE.BAT > NOPE.OUT. Genuine results: the child runs (its
internal ECHO goes to the screen, so TRACE.TXT is created empty); the
missing batch prints Bad command or file name on the screen and still
leaves NOPE.OUT created empty. The redirect target is therefore opened
before CALL resolves its batch, and CALL is not refused as an unknown
external command.
